    "detailed_description": "As soon as you wake up, life does not wait and you start to struggle.<br>Choose to eat whatever you can find and stick with what you learn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738710/extras/2d52205ff837c2e319568df425087c04.avif?t=1713259403\" width=318 height=250 /></span><br><br>Controls:<br>-    WASD/L-Stick: Move<br>-    Mouse/R-Stick: Move Camera<br>-    E/B: Interact<br>-    Shift/X: Crouch<br>-    Space/A: Jump<br>++         <i>Crouch + Jump: Long Jump</i><br>-    LMB/RT(/RB): Attack<br>++         <i>Jump + Attack: S-Jump</i><br>++         <i>Move Back + Attack: S-Attack</i><br>-    RMB/LT(/LB): Aim Mode<br>++         <i>Aim Mode + Attack: Shoot</i><br>-    MMB/R-Stick-In: Target Lock<br>-    Q/Select: Check Watch<br>-    Esc/Start: Pause<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738710/extras/0bc95bcf2622071d9ae90752ee519d30.avif?t=1713259403\" width=618 height=300 /></span><br><br>Stranded on Planet Mort you go through one single day trying to stay alive.<br>Every passing hour of that day breeds a new scenario with another problem to be solved.<br>Your sole goal is to avoid starvation, your status is indicated in the top right of the HUD.<br>To progress through the day, use mechanics such as running, jumping, diving, melee fighting, driving and shooting.<br>There are multiple minigames and secret areas waiting to be found.<br>The game supports manual saving and lets you create up to three save slots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738710/extras/e4f32b86fe8fda7ec8d8002609e000ea.avif?t=1713259403\" width=64 height=64 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "As soon as you wake up, life does not wait and you start to struggle.<br>Choose to eat whatever you can find and stick with what you learn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738710/extras/2d52205ff837c2e319568df425087c04.avif?t=1713259403\" width=318 height=250 /></span><br><br>Controls:<br>-    WASD/L-Stick: Move<br>-    Mouse/R-Stick: Move Camera<br>-    E/B: Interact<br>-    Shift/X: Crouch<br>-    Space/A: Jump<br>++         <i>Crouch + Jump: Long Jump</i><br>-    LMB/RT(/RB): Attack<br>++         <i>Jump + Attack: S-Jump</i><br>++         <i>Move Back + Attack: S-Attack</i><br>-    RMB/LT(/LB): Aim Mode<br>++         <i>Aim Mode + Attack: Shoot</i><br>-    MMB/R-Stick-In: Target Lock<br>-    Q/Select: Check Watch<br>-    Esc/Start: Pause<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738710/extras/0bc95bcf2622071d9ae90752ee519d30.avif?t=1713259403\" width=618 height=300 /></span><br><br>Stranded on Planet Mort you go through one single day trying to stay alive.<br>Every passing hour of that day breeds a new scenario with another problem to be solved.<br>Your sole goal is to avoid starvation, your status is indicated in the top right of the HUD.<br>To progress through the day, use mechanics such as running, jumping, diving, melee fighting, driving and shooting.<br>There are multiple minigames and secret areas waiting to be found.<br>The game supports manual saving and lets you create up to three save slots.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738710/extras/e4f32b86fe8fda7ec8d8002609e000ea.avif?t=1713259403\" width=64 height=64 /></span>",
